# Design-conformance verdict

**Not design-conformant as a completed Wave 1.** I found **6 SILENT-DIVERGENCE** items and **3 DESIGN-DEBT** items. Most conspicuous textual mismatches—new record envelope, stored ordinals, `at`, `prev`/`rh`, batch rows sharing an outer ordinal, `(record_ordinal, fact_id)` CAS, `ts` as an envelope key, and ordering-only checkpoint dispatch—are licensed by later ratified slice decisions and are therefore **RULED-DEVIATION**, not findings.

No files were changed. Targeted verification passed: **56 engine tests + 16 store merge-driver tests**.

